<script setup>import e from '../data/report-evidence.json';import artifacts from '../data/model-artifacts.json';const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL</script>
<template><div class="stack"><div class="photo-grid"><figure class="photo-frame"><img class="photo" style="height:165px;object-fit:contain" :src="base+artifacts.query.original" alt="Real FiveK original example"/><figcaption>Original O · real dataset example</figcaption></figure><figure class="photo-frame"><img class="photo" style="height:165px;object-fit:contain" :src="base+artifacts.query.target" alt="Real FiveK Expert C target"/><figcaption>Target T · real Expert C edit</figcaption></figure><figure class="photo-frame"><img v-if="artifacts.reconstruction" class="photo" style="height:165px;object-fit:contain" :src="base+artifacts.reconstruction.image" alt="Exported decoder reconstruction"/><div v-else class="missing" style="height:165px"><strong>Reconstruction not supplied</strong><span class="small">Requires the Phase 1 checkpoint output.</span></div><figcaption>Model output T̂ · evidence slot</figcaption></figure></div><div class="split grow"><div class="col"><h3>Reported dataset reconstruction</h3><div class="row"><div v-for="r in e.reconstruction" :key="r.dataset" style="flex:1"><p class="small">{{r.dataset}}</p><p class="big" style="font-size:48px">{{r.psnr.toFixed(1)}}<small> dB</small></p></div></div><p class="small muted">The displayed photograph is not assigned either aggregate score.</p></div><div class="col"><h3>Separate noise diagnostic · 10 images</h3><div class="row"><div><p class="small">Clean z</p><p class="big blue" style="font-size:44px">30.048</p></div><span class="arrow">→</span><div><p class="small">Noise: 0.1 × train std</p><p class="big" style="font-size:44px">29.844</p></div></div><p class="small muted">Limited local stability evidence, not a dataset-level reconstruction estimate.</p></div></div><p class="note">The target image must be available to the edit encoder for this reconstruction test. This measures representation capacity, not target-free retouching prediction.</p></div></template>
